&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item#:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP 5129&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Thaumiel&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP 5129 is to in a 5 by 5-meter room. With these materials a gaming pc, a tv, and a gaming console. He said if he doesn&#039;t get what he wants he destroy the whole foundation. One person can only go into his cell.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP 5129 is a humanoid who has powers. Gender is male. Age is ten. Real name is &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;Calvin Boone&lt;/span&gt;. That can destroy the universe normally he is good but sometimes he takes advantage of his powers. Like threaten people to get what he wants. Which is not fair and also fights dangerous SCPs in the testing of his abilities. Also, He is used to containing other SCPs. The humaniod has every single super power and has the ability go to heaven without passing away. We didn&#039;t learn much about him.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darvor&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7172128&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1610008148&quot; alt=&quot;DarVor &quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7172128)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darvor&quot;  &gt;DarVor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
