I am sorry. I shouldn&#039;t have treated you the way I did. That wasn&#039;t very friend-like of me and I sincerely hope you&#039;re being treated better wherever you are now.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
- Rex.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
