&lt;p&gt;Dr. Thatcher,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have worked with the Foundation for nine years, Dr. Thatcher. Nine years of experience working with mechanical anomalies, working with everything from toasters to living constructs. And those nine years of top-quality work have earned you a few forgivable actions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You used one of them up just now with SCP-5958. But you have very little experience with cognitohazards, apparently. As such, you are removed from all other SCP objects until this is fixed, and I want you in my office tomorrow morning at 9:00AM exactly to discuss how you&#039;re doing that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do &lt;em&gt;not&lt;/em&gt; let this happen again. I can only defend you so many times.&lt;/p&gt;
